# Bulky binary AAR (~54 MB) fetched by the `downloadSherpaAar` Gradle task (wired into `:app`'s preBuild;
# :data:speech:sherpa fetches the same file if it builds first). No manual curl step needed. It lives at the
# repo root because BOTH modules consume it — :app packages its JNI `.so`, :data:speech:sherpa extracts its
# `com.k2fsa.sherpa.onnx` classes — and neither owns the other's build dir.
third_party/sherpa-onnx-*.aar

# Sherpa-ONNX `com.k2fsa.sherpa.onnx.*` classes.jar, extracted from the AAR by :data:speech:sherpa's
# `prepareSherpaClasses` task (the per-OS native `.so`/`.dylib`/`.dll` land under build/, already ignored).
data/speech/sherpa/libs/sherpa-onnx-classes-*.jar
